{
  "body": "\\section{A numbered section}\\label{_3d73c038dae8b1a7c244ec9b8a5c8c8f2674b01}\n\nSee Section~\\ref{_3d73c038dae8b1a7c244ec9b8a5c8c8f2674b01}, Chapter~\\ref{_3d73c038dae8b1a7c244ec9b8a5c8c8f2674b01}, Fig.~\\ref{_42fd094a4df33c19890c99aadb99becc8f11e8d}, page~\\pageref{_bf3da126b9f9c6c63fd6dd28017674a1e82a4b0}, and \\eqref{_bf3da126b9f9c6c63fd6dd28017674a1e82a4b0}.\n\n\\begin{figure}[htbp]\n\\centering\n\\includegraphics[width=\\linewidth,height=\\textheight,keepaspectratio]{paper.final_assets/plot.png}\n\\caption{A referenced figure}\\label{_42fd094a4df33c19890c99aadb99becc8f11e8d}\n\\end{figure}\n\n\\begin{equation}\nx = 1\n\\label{_bf3da126b9f9c6c63fd6dd28017674a1e82a4b0}\n\\end{equation}\n\n\\subsection*{An unnumbered heading}\\label{_76a20ca8ce7bf40e125da4827ecfd21f6768f7e}\n\\addcontentsline{toc}{subsection}{An unnumbered heading}\n\nA reference to an unnumbered heading: \\hyperref[_76a20ca8ce7bf40e125da4827ecfd21f6768f7e]{An unnumbered heading}.\n\n\\subsection{Results and discussion}\\label{_ca0a51c6bd51be63cd201e7aafb2a2c80ddc4b2}\n\nSee \\hyperref[_ca0a51c6bd51be63cd201e7aafb2a2c80ddc4b2]{the results}.\n\n\\begin{figure}[htbp]\n\\centering\n\\includegraphics[width=\\linewidth,height=\\textheight,keepaspectratio]{paper.final_assets/plot.png}\n\\caption{First figure}\\label{_3ea034c099679bbe7b93620746faecac9592659}\n\\end{figure}\n\n\\begin{figure}[htbp]\n\\centering\n\\includegraphics[width=\\linewidth,height=\\textheight,keepaspectratio]{paper.final_assets/diagram.svg.pdf}\n\\caption{Second figure}\\label{_7238ae89068752bade5fdbb063c62530c3da8d4}\n\\end{figure}\n\nA label group Figure~\\ref{_3ea034c099679bbe7b93620746faecac9592659}, Figure~\\ref{_7238ae89068752bade5fdbb063c62530c3da8d4}.\n\nCitations \\textcites{doe2020}[p.~12]{lee2019}, \\autocite*{knuth1984}, and \\autocite[see][]{doe2020}.\n\nWrite @literal for an at sign and keep the dot after Section~\\ref{_x}.\n\n\\subsubsection{A trailing punctuation target}\\label{_x}\n\n\\subsubsection{A